%% SM-04 Scholarship lifecycle
%% Values: Scholarship model status constants. There is no guard class;
%% state is a free-form column constrained by constants and admin screens.
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> draft : admin creates scholarship

    draft --> open : publish / activate
    open --> closed : deactivate
    closed --> open : reactivate
    open --> archived : archive
    closed --> archived : archive
    archived --> [*]

    note right of open
        Visible to students only when:
          status = open
          AND application_start_date <= today
          AND today <= application_deadline
        (Scholarship::scopeAvailableForStudents)
    end note

    note left of draft
        draft is never visible to students.
        Requirements and thresholds may be
        edited freely while draft.
    end note
